Title: 200 AMSTERDAM: THE VERTICAL CITY
Credit: Written for the Screen by
Author: Danny Bouldiez
Episode: PART 09: THE WEIGHT OF THE LIVING (CHAPTER 08)

====

INT. 200 AMSTERDAM - FLOOR 30 SKY LOBBY - NIGHT

Smoke and dust fill the air. Emergency sirens WAIL. 

ELENA VANCE helps an elderly woman wrapped in a thermal blanket. 

JULIAN and ELEANOR arrive through the stairwell door, coughing.

                         JULIAN
          The ground floor lobby is blocked. The sub-street 
          hydraulic gates sealed automatically when the power failed!

                         ELENA
          We're trapped inside the pressure hull. 

                         ELEANOR
          (clutching Julian's hand)
          Julian... the water is coming up from below.

Elena looks through the cracked glass window down at Amsterdam Avenue.

The street below is flooded. Police boats and emergency lights illuminate the swirling water. 

There is no way down. The only way out is through the subterranean maintenance drainage conduits.

FADE TO BLACK.
